              "curator": "claude_sssom_surface_form_backfill",
              "action": "ADDED_SYNONYMS",
              "changes": "Recovered 1 surface form(s) that the published SSSOM `other` carried but no curated record did, so a rebuild would have dropped them from KGX: 'Na2B4O7 ·  10 H2O'. Tokens already present on the kg-microbe ontology node were left out as redundant (#520).",
              "llm_assisted": false
            },
            {
              "timestamp": "2026-11-08T04:36:22.312690+00:00",
              "curator": "worker01_add_media_identity",
              "action": "CORRECTED",
              "changes": "Isolated proposal: replace internally inconsistent CHEBI131366 identity/properties with structurally exact CHEBI38888 after primary formula-accounting verification. Preserve conventionaldecahydrate raw labels, all original history/counts and unreviewed roles. The source conventional sodium tetraborate decahydrate formula Na2B4O7·10H2O and structural borax formula Na2[B4O5(OH)4]·8H2O denote the same bulk material. Gainsford etal2008 DOI10.1107/S1600536808010441 explicitly identifies sodium tetraborate decahydrate as the latter structural formula, with Mr381.38. Official CHEBI38888 has that structural formula and381.371 mass; its octahydrate label counts the eight molecular waters after hydroxylation and does not mean Na2B4O7·8H2O. Official supplier CAS1303-96-4/Na2B4O7·10H2O/MW381.37 independently corroborates supplied form. CHEBI131366 and86222 instead contain two excess waters and remain upstream defects. This identity proposal covers explicitly weighed decahydrate reagent contexts; DSMZ7700.1%w/v stock remains a distinct preparation, so no global mediadive.ingredient:196 exact redirect is approved.",
              "previous_status": "MAPPED",
              "new_status": "MAPPED",
              "llm_assisted": true
            }
          ],
          "ingredient_type": "SINGLE_INGREDIENT",
          "chemical_properties": {
            "cas_rn": "1303-96-4",
            "molecular_formula": "8H2O.H4B4O9.2Na",
            "inchi": "InChI=1S/B4H4O9.2Na.8H2O/c5-1-9-3(7)11-2(6)12-4(8,10-1)13-3;;;;;;;;;;/h5-8H;;;8*1H2/q-2;2*+1;;;;;;;;",
            "smiles": "[H]OB1O[B-]2(O[H])OB(O[H])O[B-](O[H])(O1)O2.[H]O[H].[H]O[H].[H]O[H].[H]O[H].[H]O[H].[H]O[H].[H]O[H].[H]O[H].[Na+].[Na+]",
            "data_source": "Official OLS CHEBI38888 structure; CAS from official SigmaS9640; primary structure DOI10.1107/S1600536808010441"
          },
          "occurrence_statistics": {
            "total_occurrences": 263,
